<body><div class="bar"><img src="{!URLFOR($Resource.Lumina_Welcome_Header)}" alt="Lumina Care"/></div><div class="wrap"><div class="card"><h1>The report site is temporarily unavailable.</h1><p>Use the link from your readmissions report email. If it no longer works, reply to that email and Lumina Care will send a new one.</p></div></div></body></html>
